    "project-type": "corpus",
    "blurb": "CMAwRo 3 presents online the text editions and translations from Tzvi Abusch, Daniel Schwemer, Mikko Luukko and Greta Van Buylaere, Corpus of Mesopotamian Anti-witchcraft Rituals, vol. 3 (Ancient Magic and Divination 8/3, Brill: 2020).    The volume was lemmatized by Mikko Luukko and Greta Van Buylaere as part of the DFG-funded research project \"Corpus babylonischer Rituale und Beschwörungen gegen Schadenzauber: Edition, lexikalische Erschließung, historische und literarische Analyse\", directed by Daniel Schwemer (University of Würzburg).     <a href=\"https://brill.com/view/title/15360\">Buy the book</a> from Brill   ",
